package com.techouts.assessment2.collections;

Comparable : It is an interface
    1. It is used to sort the objects by required fields
    2. Using compareTo method we sort the fields
    3. Single sorting Technique / order
    4. Collections.sort(list)

Comparator : It is an interface
    1. It is also used to sort/order the objects by required fields
    2. Using compare method we sort the fields
    3. Multiple sorting Techniques/orders
    4. Collections.sort(list,new Comparator());
       list.sort(Comparator);